{"ref":"BDB, מִקְוֶה","hw":"מִקְוֶה","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְוֶה</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>hope</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.15\">1 Ch 29:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:2\" href=\"/Ezra.10.2\">Ezr 10:2</a>; cstr. in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְוֵה יִשְׂרָאֵל</span>, epithet of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.8\">Je 14:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.13\">17:13</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.7\">50:7</a>.","next":"BDB, תִּקְוָה","prev":"BDB, קַוְקָו"}